      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "# May 8, 2026 - Polymarket Trader Debugging & Wallet Alignment ## Wallet & Key Analysis - Identified a complex wallet mismatch causing trade failures: - **Wallet A (`0x7eBA28...`)**: Linked to the stored private key `0xd2aad0f4...` and current API keys. Balance: $0. - **Wallet B (`0x98D9Dbd...`)**: The primary funded Polymarket wallet (~$26.11). - **Wallet C (`0xf828D6d...`)**: Mentioned as the app wallet. - **Key Insight**: API keys are cryptographically bound to the wallet they were created for. Swapping the funder address in config without updating the API keys causes signature failures. ## System Status & Fixes - **Traders**: All 4 portfolio traders (ETH, BTC, LINK, Weather",
