      "snippet": "## Penny the Cat (Bengal F4 SBT) - **Lineage:** Penny is an F4 SBT (Stud Book Tradition) Bengal. - **Legal Status (EU):** F4 Bengals are often classified as \"hybrids\" or \"wild cats\" in many EU countries, requiring CITES permits or risking quarantine. Domestic status typically starts at F5. - **Travel:** Italy is identified as a likely safe destination for F4 Bengals. Iceland and Switzerland are considered high-risk due to strict import laws and the F4 hybrid status. - **Behavior & Traits:** - Plays \"hide and seek\" (tags the human when found). - Performs \"cat kisses\" (slow winks), indicating trust and affection. - High prey drive: Once caught and brought back a whole pheasant.",
